  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large copper mug over medium heat.",
    "Add pork belly and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add sliced ginger and minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add Korean pear, fish sauce, soy sauce, and honey. Stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Add cinnamon and salt (if using). Simmer for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional Korean pear slices if desired.",
    "Let cool completely before refrigerating or freezing for later use."
